("littleones-au-4999301524","parent_unspecified","regression_4_month","tried_failed",["course_purchase","price_value"],"I may have said “this is bull####, what a waste of money” to my husband on the first morning. But I persisted","5-star review; four-month-old who woke every two hours and needed holding.",""),
("littleones-au-4999301524","parent_unspecified","regression_4_month","belief",["schedule_rigidity","wake_windows"],"a great part of this app is that you can use as much of the advice as you’d like. We don’t follow the routines religiously","5-star review.",""),
("littleones-au-8102666681","parent_unspecified","baby_5_8_months","objection",["schedule_rigidity"],"I was sceptical about the program because I was worried about following a “schedule”, but it has been exactly what my son needed.","5-star review titled 'It’s not a gimmick!'.",""),
("littleones-au-8102666681","parent_unspecified","baby_2_4_months","pain",["pacifier","night_wakings","maternal_exhaustion"],"We were using a dummy to settle, sometimes hourly overnight. We felt like zombies!","5-star review; son struggled to settle from 3.5 months.",""),
("littleones-au-14081586897","experienced_mother","unknown","others_said",["schedule_rigidity","information_overload"],"Being new to parenting, I remember everyone asking if I’d gotten Bub in to a routine yet but I had absolutely no idea how to do that.","5-star review; now on second baby and twins.",""),
("littleones-au-14081586897","experienced_mother","baby_5_8_months","success_story",["schedule_rigidity"],"It just really took a lot of the guesswork out - I knew she had the right amount of sleep, so I could put any fussiness down to discomfort or hunger.","5-star review.",""),
("littleones-au-13345768119","new_mother","unknown","desire",["night_wakings","information_overload"],"I have always been able to find my answers in the middle of the night using the search bar. So good when you just want an immediate answer/solution to try.","5-star review; first-time mother.",""),
("littleones-au-13404029195","new_mother","baby_2_4_months","pain",["contact_naps","short_naps"],"he would only catnap during the day in his bassinet for like 15 minutes and only have long naps on me. Which is fine, I love a contact nap, but I also like to be able to eat and shower and go to the toilet.","5-star review; three-month-old, first day of the program.",""),
("littleones-au-13404029195","new_mother","baby_2_4_months","tried_failed",["conflicting_advice","information_overload"],"My partner and I both have ADHD and are of course first time parents so there has definitely been challenges even after trying to follow a lot of different advice online.","5-star review.","mental health (self-reported ADHD)"),
("littleones-au-9758667783","parent_unspecified","unknown","price_signal",["sleep_consultant","price_value"],"I paid for the village access and have been disappointed. It’s marketed as access to sleep consultants but in reality, it’s just you asking a question and them replying hours later with generic info that can be found in the app.","3-star review on the paid consultant forum.",""),
("littleones-au-12544843645","parent_unspecified","toddler_12_24_months","failure_story",["course_purchase","bedtime_battle"],"Been trying this program/app for 4 months now with no real progress or change in our 1.5 year olds sleep. [...] I found the advice wasn’t anything I hadn’t read/tried before","1-star review titled 'Wouldn’t recommend'.",""),
("littleones-au-12544843645","parent_unspecified","toddler_12_24_months","objection",["bedtime_battle","schedule_rigidity","course_purchase"],"it’s taking me an hour and a half to get my toddler to sleep so she didn’t end up falling asleep in the window you set, that’s why I purchased this sleep help program","1-star review; the tracker rejected logs outside the set window.",""),
("littleones-au-6074537612","experienced_mother","unknown","tried_failed",["schedule_rigidity","personalization"],"My baby needed more sleep than the schedule suggested so I always went on a schedule for a baby a few months younger and just followed loosely.","2-star review; 'obsessed over 2 kids with sleep issues'.",""),
("littleones-ca-13201658947","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["schedule_rigidity","personalization"],"the tracker is clunky and cannot always adapt to your child’s nap, if it goes off schedule. [...] Would maybe recommend, but only if you have prior sleep knowledge and if you can figure out day to day adaptation on your own.","3-star review; bought on sale.",""),
("littleones-ca-14067925252","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["course_purchase","price_value"],"I’m going to start this off by saying this company preys on desperate, sleep deprived parents.","1-star review titled 'Waste of money and deceitful'.",""),
("littleones-ca-14067925252","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["sleep_consultant","price_value"],"if you have any real issue they tell you to go pay to talk to a consultant.","1-star review on the 'village' support.",""),
("littleones-ca-14067925252","parent_unspecified","unknown","price_signal",["money_back","price_value"],"we purchased the year and asked if we could get portions back for what we didn’t use.","1-star review; refund refused.",""),
("littleones-ca-14067925252","parent_unspecified","unknown","advice_given",["schedule_rigidity","price_value"],"If your baby has true sleeping issues, this app is NOT for you. If you’re trying to just get a  set schedule…Google it.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-ca-13284543404","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["money_back"],"When you go to purchase it says there is a 30 day money back guarantee. When you contact them they refer you to the fine print which says no refunds if you bought it on sale and also if you don’t use it and log for 2 consecutive weeks.","1-star review titled 'Deceptive refund policy'.",""),
("littleones-ca-12267116089","parent_unspecified","unknown","price_signal",["price_value"],"they changed the model to a one-time pay app over a year ago. Despite being a loyal customer, no one notified me of the change so my subscription renewed and Ive paid over triple the price necessary for this year.","3-star review titled 'Make sure you have ended your subscription'; nearly four years subscribed.",""),
("littleones-ca-13124945337","parent_unspecified","baby_2_4_months","regret",["personalization","course_purchase"],"I purchased the little ones subscription when I was in the throes of sleep deprivation with my three month old baby last year, and I completely regret this purchase as the advice they give you is literally the same boiler plate schedule, regardless of your baby’s age or your particular circumstances.","1-star review titled 'Gaslighting and total waste of money'.",""),
("littleones-ca-13124945337","parent_unspecified","baby_2_4_months","tried_failed",["sleep_consultant","schedule_rigidity"],"When you go to the community asking for one on one help, (which was the key selling feature of this app for me) they just parrot the same schedule at you even when you’ve told them it’s not working.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-ca-13124945337","parent_unspecified","baby_2_4_months","objection",["short_naps","night_wakings","schedule_rigidity"],"Telling parents who have children who do not nap for longer than 30 minutes and won’t sleep longer than 2 hours at a time at night that they just need to “put their child down for a two hour nap in the middle of the day” to get back on track and improve nightslerp is not helpful.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-ca-12691010764","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["money_back"],"Contacted customer service and was told they will only refund if I use their service for two weeks and don’t see improvement. They just want your money!!","1-star review; never opened the app after buying.",""),
("littleones-ca-12549929627","new_mother","unknown","objection",["app_tracking","maternal_exhaustion"],"When you are sleep deprived and exhausted, the last thing you need is to spend an extra 10minutes to log in data after every nap/night/feed etc.","2-star review.",""),
("littleones-ca-12549929627","new_mother","unknown","objection",["money_back"],"To get a refund based on 30 days warranty … you have to jump through a lot of hoops and as a sleep deprived mother, it is just too much.","2-star review; 'money in the garbage'.",""),
("littleones-ca-12425207141","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["schedule_rigidity"],"It is very schedule based and unrealistic!","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-ca-12363436627","parent_unspecified","baby_5_8_months","success_story",["gentle_method","short_naps"],"Honestly this app teaches your little one how to sleep through the night by napping during the day like a pro.","4-star review; extras such as consultants cost more.",""),
("littleones-gb-12182814319","parent_unspecified","unknown","desire",["cry_it_out","course_purchase"],"I was hoping this would include videos of, for example, babies doing the different types of cries so I could understand when my own baby was crying up vs protest crying vs winding down, or demonstrations of the settling methods on real babies.","4-star review; videos were mostly founders talking to camera.",""),
("littleones-gb-12182814319","parent_unspecified","unknown","desire",["personalization","information_overload"],"There is a lot of “troubleshooting” information on the app but I agree with other reviewers that it’s not always particularly easy to find at the time that you need it. An interactive decision tree (ie where you select from a few options to identify your problem and it then provides advice for that problem) would be helpful.","4-star review.",""),
("littleones-gb-11503145974","parent_unspecified","regression_4_month","trigger_moment",["regression_4_month","information_overload"],"By the time the 4 month regression hit and I’d read the whole of the internet, Little Ones got advertised to me and I got on board.","5-star review titled 'Best money ever spent!'.",""),
("littleones-gb-11503145974","parent_unspecified","baby_9_12_months","price_signal",["sleep_consultant","price_value"],"It’s a fraction of the price compared to 1-1 sleep consultants but you may only resolve sleep issues in the short term with a sleep consultant, whereas Little Ones supports you through all ages, regressions and transitions.","5-star review; paid two months of consultant access.",""),
("littleones-gb-10079194589","experienced_mother","toddler_12_24_months","failure_story",["schedule_rigidity","consistency_failure"],"However, when you have a toddler to parent as well, that’s not always an option. And as stated in the pre-reading, this programme only works 100% if you stick to it 100%.","3-star review; worked for first child, not the second.",""),
("littleones-gb-10079194589","experienced_mother","toddler_12_24_months","failure_story",["consistency_failure","night_wakings"],"the second she’s home/ he goes through a phase/ we stay a night away/ he’s teething etc. etc. etc., he just reverts and we’d have to do the whole thing again which isn’t an option for us.","3-star review; 14-month-old still wakes nightly.",""),
("littleones-gb-8855618561","new_mother","newborn_0_8_weeks","purchase",["course_purchase","maternal_exhaustion"],"I downloaded this app for the free 2 week trial very early postpartum as a sleep deprived and overwhelmed new mother.","1-star review titled 'Awful company'.",""),
("littleones-gb-8855618561","new_mother","unknown","objection",["money_back","price_value"],"they operate a no refunds for subscriptions policy but they do not bother to send a courtesy email reminding subscribers that a renewal is imminent.","1-star review; charged a second year after cancelling via the App Store.",""),
("littleones-gb-14514925849","parent_unspecified","baby_5_8_months","belief",["wake_windows","schedule_rigidity"],"Babies are not robots, not all babies need the same wake windows as each other, or the same wake windows everyday. In fact I no longer believe in wake windows and am more inclined to work off of when my baby looks tired.","2-star review; tried the program at 10 weeks, 3 and 5 months.",""),
("littleones-gb-14514925849","parent_unspecified","baby_5_8_months","tried_failed",["sleep_consultant","personalization"],"Their responses are almost copy and paste. I was constantly told that the issue with my baby not sleeping properly was due to her not “self settling” there was no other considerations made.","2-star review on the paid consultants.",""),
("littleones-gb-14514925849","parent_unspecified","baby_5_8_months","tried_failed",["app_tracking"],"have moved over to the most popular app (beginning with H) and have already had more success in one night.","2-star review.",""),
("littleones-gb-4537076899","parent_unspecified","toddler_12_24_months","desire",["course_purchase","information_overload"],"Little one is used to provide a PDF of the program. They no longer supply this. [...] But what is most annoying is not being able to edit or make notes on the pages, which is vital for sleep deprived mums to help absorb the information.","2-star review titled 'Great content - rubbish app'; bought baby and toddler programs.",""),
("littleones-gb-4537076899","parent_unspecified","toddler_12_24_months","price_signal",["course_purchase","price_value"],"if people contact you to ask for a PDF (as they paid a considerable amount of money) consider saying yes.","2-star review.",""),
("littleones-gb-9598814300","new_mother","baby_5_8_months","price_signal",["price_value","course_purchase"],"there’s no reason to charge £60 for pre written schedules and troubleshooting advice.","1-star review titled 'Most stressful time of my life'.",""),
("littleones-gb-9598814300","new_mother","baby_5_8_months","question",["schedule_rigidity","consistency_failure"],"Maybe the schedule would work but how do I get my baby on it in the first place, everyday is troubleshooting a different issue","1-star review; three weeks in.",""),
("littleones-gb-9598814300","new_mother","baby_5_8_months","pain",["guilt","schedule_rigidity"],"This app has made me feel that if the schedule isn’t working it’s my fault, making my mum guilt and stress levels go through the roof.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-gb-9598814300","new_mother","baby_5_8_months","pain",["schedule_rigidity","maternal_exhaustion"],"every-time I’m 5 mins off the schedule I’m about to breakdown because I haven’t slept in 5 months and the whole day is about to be ruined.","1-star review; told a 5-10 minute variation could throw off the next nap.","mental health (near-breakdown, severe stress)"),
("littleones-gb-9346318654","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["personalization","schedule_rigidity"],"the structure does not take into account how every baby is different and some have higher or lower sleep needs than others. Not every baby is capable of sleeping for 12 hrs at night","1-star review; followed the schedule exactly for 3 weeks.",""),
("littleones-gb-9346318654","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["gentle_method","cry_it_out","sleep_training_values"],"they say a lot of stuff about their self settling techniques being gentle, and having different techniques depending on the issue - but honestly all their techniques are actually exactly the same","1-star review; felt the 'gentle' marketing was false.",""),
("littleones-gb-5866998759","advisor","newborn_0_8_weeks","others_said",["nap_transition","schedule_rigidity"],"he needs the fourth sleep and to let him do what he needs to in terms of sleep, and to follow his queues rather than getting him on some sort of schedule that’s convenient for the adults.","1-star review; parent reports what an experienced sleep advisor told them after dropping to three naps.",""),
("littleones-gb-11805150625","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["money_back","sleep_consultant"],"They are advertising 24/7 support, which I had to wait a day until someone responded","1-star review; refund refused until two weeks of use.",""),
("littleones-gb-11805150625","parent_unspecified","unknown","pain",["course_purchase"],"I was desperate for a little help and instead of help I’ve got more thing to worry about.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-14098587804","experienced_mother","unknown","tried_failed",["sleep_consultant","schedule_rigidity"],"Only tip to watch out for is that the consulting assumes strictly following schedule. If you are not then the broad tips still help but talking to the consultants doesn’t result in direct help.","4-star review; tried multiple sleep training apps first.",""),
("littleones-us-8260163764","new_mother","regression_4_month","others_said",["conflicting_advice","cry_it_out","information_overload"],"Two family members told me about Healthy Sleep, Happy Baby, and how their husbands had to stop them from going into their baby’s room when the baby was crying inconsolably. My aunt even gave me the book. First of all, as a sleep deprived mom, I did not have the time or mental energy to read such a large book.","5-star review; four-month-old rocked and held for every sleep.",""),
("littleones-us-8260163764","new_mother","regression_4_month","desire",["information_overload","course_purchase"],"I was able to get started immediately, I didn’t have to read extensively before implementing it, which is what you need when you are desperate for sleep.","5-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-8260163764","new_mother","regression_4_month","belief",["sleep_props","gentle_method"],"When the program said that the goal was to put your baby down wide awake, and letting him put himself asleep, I thought that was a wild fantasy!","5-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-6245646719","new_mother","looking_back","regret",["schedule_rigidity","course_purchase"],"Buying this program was the biggest mistake that I made in my baby’s first year. My baby had a very difficult time syncing with their schedule, and it often turned me into a stressed out mama trying to force sleep on her baby when it was the last thing in the world she wanted.","1-star review titled 'Save yourself the heartache'.",""),
("littleones-us-6245646719","new_mother","looking_back","objection",["sleep_consultant","schedule_rigidity"],"If you’re having an issue and you’re not on their schedule to the T, they deem your baby as overtired. I can’t tell you how many times I’ve been told that my baby is overtired","1-star review on the expert feedback.",""),
("littleones-us-6245646719","new_mother","looking_back","tried_failed",["sleep_consultant","course_purchase"],"I found the courses and sleep consultants from Taking Cara Babies much more helpful.","1-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-8013291066","new_mother","regression_4_month","tried_failed",["information_overload"],"I read and tried two popular books - Babywise and Healthy Sleep Habits, Happy Child but they did not help one bit.","5-star review; four-month-old waking hourly for three weeks.",""),
("littleones-us-8013291066","new_mother","regression_4_month","desire",["personalization"],"It's 100% geared toward the weeks of age my baby is and his developmental needs","5-star review; first reason listed for loving it.",""),
("littleones-us-8013291066","new_mother","regression_4_month","price_signal",["price_value"],"Just a great program and so worth the price. Getting a good night sleep is priceless to me.","5-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-6989925365","parent_unspecified","regression_4_month","tried_failed",["information_overload"],"We had read countless books, Google, you name it, but little ones simplified all the noise and presented an easy to follow program that worked.","5-star review; bought at four months.",""),
("littleones-us-11484809726","new_mother","baby_2_4_months","success_story",["maternal_exhaustion"],"It made me like my baby again.","4-star review titled 'Honest new mom review'; 3.5-month-old.","mental health (maternal bonding / distress)"),
("littleones-us-11484809726","new_mother","baby_2_4_months","belief",["schedule_rigidity"],"I am not able to follow the program to a T because of work, however we use the general idea and schedule then shift as needed in small amounts.","4-star review.",""),
("littleones-us-6154699720","parent_unspecified","regression_4_month","desire",["personalization","schedule_rigidity"],"Inability to customize when our day starts. Their day starts at 8 am, so I am not able to use the reminders or the app to its fullest potential.","4-star review; twins.",""),
("littleones-us-4409563422","parent_unspecified","unknown","tried_failed",["sleep_consultant","schedule_rigidity"],"You: my child isn't sleeping the way your schedule says they will. I'm doing everything you say and it isn't working. Them: you must be doing something wrong.","2-star review; reviewer's own rendering of support exchanges.",""),
